# the forced arms of darksamus_fsm2_force3.py. The twelve AI hints of area 65 get the types the
# phazon states look up (`hint`): all type 6 (12 active: the count limit 10), a second lookup (the
# hint the first one took is in use), one deactivated; then all type 7 for GoToPhazonEnrage (one
# moved to another area for the call: the area arm; then back, 11 active: the type-7 count limit);
# then one type-7 hint for PhazonRise's move, and the hint and the actor on one spot (no flat
# direction); three shots in flight as MissileDeflect starts, far/near/far (fn_10_1BC58: a farther
# one after the nearest in either near-list order).
@f600 send u04f7 Activate
@f650 objs AIHint
@f700 hint u066d 6; hint u066c 6; hint u066b 6; hint u066a 6; hint u0668 6; hint u0667 6; hint u0665 6; hint u0664 6; hint u0663 6; hint u064d 6; hint u064b 6; hint u064a 6
@f704 statecall u04f7 GoToPhazonAttack 0
@f708 statecall u04f7 GoToPhazonAttack 0
@f712 send u064a Deactivate
@f716 statecall u04f7 GoToPhazonAttack 0
@f720 hint u066d 7; hint u066c 7; hint u066b 7; hint u066a 7; hint u0668 7; hint u0667 7; hint u0665 7; hint u0664 7; hint u0663 7; hint u064d 7; hint u064b 7; hint u064a 7
@f722 hint u0663 area 99
@f724 statecall u04f7 GoToPhazonEnrage 0
@f726 hint u0663 area 65
@f728 statecall u04f7 GoToPhazonEnrage 0
@f730 hint u066d 0; hint u066c 0; hint u066b 0; hint u066a 0; hint u0668 0; hint u0667 0; hint u0665 0; hint u0664 0; hint u0663 0; hint u064d 0; hint u064b 0; hint u064a 0; hint u066d 7; hint u066d
@f740 fsm u04f7 PhazonRise
@f840 place u04f7 player 0; place u066d player 0
@f860 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f900 statecall u04f7 GetUp 0; statecall u04f7 GetUp 2; statecall u04f7 GetUp 1
@f1000 shoot u04f7 30; shoot u04f7 12; shoot u04f7 30; fsm u04f7 MissileDeflect
@f1100 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f1200 objs dark
